{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"FREE \u2014 MANY ASSETS, ONE OBJECT. The cross-asset cut of the question sheet: for the assets you name, `pending` is every open clock (soonest horizon_end first, each row carrying its asset and decision_id), `latest_terminal` is the last dead chip per question on each asset, and `dark` names each blocked question ONCE with its exact blocker. Every row is a sheet row \u2014 this tool re-derives nothing, so its pending set can never disagree with tollbridge_sheet or GET /v1/clocks/open. `assets` is comma-separated and defaults to BTC,ETH,SOL; it is capped at 20. A symbol with no live market is SKIPPED with a typed warning \u2014 the other assets still answer, never a 404 of the whole blotter. An empty `pending` is []: data, not a fabricated \"none\". THE AGENT LOOP: read the blotter \u2192 if pending is non-empty, sleep until min(pending.horizon_end) \u2192 read the resolution \u2192 ask ONLY rows with ask.allowed == true. No payment required, no clocks are started or credits spent by this read.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"assets":{"description":"Comma-separated venue symbols (e.g. \"BTC,ETH,SOL,HYPE\"); omitted \u2192 BTC,ETH,SOL. Unknown symbols are skipped with a warning.","maxLength":400,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"tollbridge_blotter","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"data":{},"error":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"code":{"enum":["VALIDATION","UNAUTHORIZED","PAYMENT_REQUIRED","PAYMENT_INVALID","PAYMENT_REPLAYED","STALE_DATA","PROVIDER_DOWN","JEV_REFUSED","INSUFFICIENT_SAMPLE","POLICY_REFUSED","RATE_LIMITED","INTERNAL"],"type":"string"},"detail":{"additionalProperties":{},"propertyNames":{"type":"string"},"type":"object"},"message":{"type":"string"},"request_id":{"type":"st